WEBVTT

00:32:58.436 --> 00:33:01.716
or provoked by sanctions
and other policies.

00:33:01.716 --> 00:33:03.956
And so she asks,

00:33:03.956 --> 00:33:07.236
"How likely is that Putin will face
a challenge from inside Russia,

00:33:07.276 --> 00:33:09.396
whether a popular uprising,
a coup or other?"

00:33:09.436 --> 00:33:12.756
IB: It's very, very unlikely
until it happens.

00:33:12.796 --> 00:33:14.516
(Chuckles)

00:33:14.556 --> 00:33:18.196
I mean, in the sense
that there is absolutely no purpose

00:33:18.236 --> 00:33:20.156
in trying to say, oh, I mean, you know,

00:33:20.196 --> 00:33:24.756
there are rumors that Defense Minister
Shoigu is unhappy and, you know,

00:33:24.756 --> 00:33:26.036
he might be making a move.

00:33:26.076 --> 00:33:28.596
And I’ve seen these
from relatively credible analysts,

00:33:28.596 --> 00:33:30.636
I'm like, no, no,
if there are such rumors,